WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:02.335
-Thank you so much
and welcome,

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.504
welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.440
This is it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.909
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.878
Well, guys, President Trump
has been trying everything

00:00:12.878 --> 00:00:14.914
to overturn the election,
and he finally got

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.383
one of his cases to
the Supreme Court.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.785
Let's see how that went.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.352 line:0%
-The Supreme Court
has shut down

00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:22.755 line:0%
one of President Trump's
latest and last attempts

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:24.457 line:0%
to overturn the election.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:27.293 line:0%
In one short sentence, the Court
denied a Republican challenge

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.629 line:0%
to the vote in Pennsylvania.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:31.163
-That is amazing.

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:34.601
They rejected Trump's whole
argument in one sentence.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.235
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.404
That's pretty much
the Supreme Court's version

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.740
of responding to a long text
with "K."

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.809
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.177
One sentence.
That page had less ink

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:46.779
than Rudy Giuliani's face.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:49.415
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:52.118
[ Rim shot ]

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.621
That's basically a tweet that
went to law school.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.624
It is the equivalent of a judge
taking off his leather glove

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:00.359
and slapping you with it.

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.995
[ Slap ]
"You fool!"

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:04.898
All of the justices were like,

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.833
"We put on our robes for this?
Wha--"

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:09.769
The Court really tried to do
Trump a favor though.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.237
They figured
if it was one sentence,

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:14.040
he would actually read it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.642
For Trump, it felt like
applying to college

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:18.778
and getting back
a thin envelope.

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.180
It is like, "Well,
this can't be good."

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.983
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.585
Trump isn't giving up though.
He's like,

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.421
Now it's time to appeal to
an even higher court,

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.956
the Jedi Council.

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:32.959
Dear @Mandalorian..."

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.527
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.762
The other big news is that
after testing positive

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:38.765
for COVID,
today Rudy Giuliani

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.668 line:0%
was discharged
from the hospital.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:45.038
Yeah. Another day, another
Rudy discharge.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.372
-Ooh!

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:49.842
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:54.012
-That is right, America's
Mr. Bean is back in action.

00:01:54.012 --> 00:01:57.183
Giuliani didn't waste any time
embarrassing himself.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.185
He waved good-bye to the doctors
wearing a gown

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.287
