He was like,

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.590
"I was just tucking it in."

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.424
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:07.693
But the hospital staff doesn't
have faith in Rudy.

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.829
On his way out, he grabbed
a Dunkin' Donuts napkin

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.396
