and blew his nose in it.

00:02:11.396 --> 00:02:13.366
It's like, "Hey, guy."

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.901
That's right, the nurses are
thrilled Rudy is gone.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.471
Now they don't have to keep
changing his head pan.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:22.441
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:25.744
That's a great joke, yeah.

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:28.280
Yeah, it seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.816
President Trump's lawsuits
continue to be thrown out.

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:33.585
